# =============================================================================
#  Tactical Tool Game - what this repo ships
# =============================================================================
#
#  This repo contains ONLY what someone needs to actually run the gamemode on
#  a server: copy gamemodes/ and maps/ into their garrysmod/ folder and go.
#
#  Development-only material is kept locally but deliberately never committed,
#  so a server operator cloning this repo gets nothing they don't need.
# =============================================================================


# --- Test suites ------------------------------------------------------------
# GLuaTest suites live at garrysmod/lua/tests/<project>/ on a real install
# (GLuaTest discovers tests by scanning the LUA search path for tests/*), so
# they are outside this repo anyway. These rules make sure they never drift in.
tests/
lua/tests/
**/tests/


# --- Developer documentation and tooling ------------------------------------
# Not needed to run a server: testing guide, and the offline GLua syntax
# checker used during development.
TESTING.md
**/TESTING.md
dev/
**/dev/


# --- Editor / OS noise ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
